        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_819_2225.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unnser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fründlich</unclear> willig diennst zuvor ersamen,
<lb n="2"/>unnd weysen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">besonnders</unclear> lieben unnd guotten
<lb n="3"/>fründt. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">WAs</unclear> widerwerttigkhait des <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">glickhs</unclear>,
<lb n="4"/>für ein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">laidiger</unclear> fahl, <persName resp="#ner">Hannsen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zu</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Augspurg</unclear></persName>, unnd
<lb n="5"/><persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eberhardt</unclear></persName> und <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Caspar</unclear></persName>, den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Zangmaistern</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gebruedern</unclear>,
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsern</unclear> mitburgern <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zugestannden</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deß</unclear> wir dem=
<lb n="7"/>nach von inen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">schrifftlich</unclear> ersucht und gebetten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wordn</unclear>
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">das</unclear> haben E. E. W. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hie</unclear> bey <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verwarttem</unclear>
<lb n="9"/>proclama <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guotter</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">massen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuvernemen</unclear>. So dann
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sollich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ansuchen</unclear>, uff <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihr</unclear> so <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">demuettigklich</unclear> bitt, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> auch
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mehrntheils</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gläubiger</unclear> bewilligen, inen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">allent</unclear>
<lb n="12"/>halben zu <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verhoffenlichem</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fürstannd</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guottem</unclear>
<lb n="13"/>von <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unns</unclear> nicht wol, oder fueglich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gewäygertt</unclear>
<lb n="14"/>werden mögen. So ist dem allem nach an E. E.
<lb n="15"/>W. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnser</unclear> fleyssig <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fründlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ersuchen</unclear> und
<lb n="16"/>bitt, Nachdem sy irem <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">anzeigen</unclear> nach <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Iren</unclear>
<lb n="17"/>burgern, herren <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jacob</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Zollikhofers</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seligen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erbn</unclear>,
<lb n="18"/>unnd <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jacob</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Staudern</unclear></persName>, auch was schuldig, Sy <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wöllen</unclear>
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">obberuertt</unclear> proclama, umb <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">iez</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ernannten</unclear>, auch
<lb n="20"/>anderer willen, denen sy ze thon schuldig sein
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">möchten</unclear>, damitt sich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unwissenhait</unclear> niemandt
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zubeklagen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deßhalben</unclear> uff <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sollichen</unclear> tage,
<lb n="23"/>durch sich selbst, oder Iren <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gewalthaber</unclear> alhie <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuer=</unclear>
<lb n="24"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">scheinen</unclear>, und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ire</unclear> gelegenhait <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">selbext</unclear> von inen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anhörn</unclear>,
<lb n="25"/>und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zunernemen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wisse</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">affigiern</unclear> und anschlagen
<lb n="26"/>lassen, Das umb E. E. W. zu dem, das es
<lb n="27"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">den</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Iren</unclear> zu <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guottem</unclear> gelangen mag, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">begern</unclear>
<lb n="28"/>wir ganz guottwillig <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fründlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuverdienen</unclear>
<lb n="29"/>dat. den .<origDate when="1562-01-24" cert="medium" resp="#ner">24. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Januarij</unclear> anno etc. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">62</unclear></origDate>.
<lb n="30"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-604" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Burgermaister</unclear> und Rath
<lb n="31"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zu</unclear> Memmingen</orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_819_2226.jpg" n="2"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_819_2227.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_819_2228.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="32"/>Den ersamen und weisen, <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burgermaister und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Rathe</unclear>
<lb n="33"/>der statt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> Sant Gallen</orgName>, unsern besondern lieben
<lb n="34"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gueten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freunden</unclear>.
</p>
